---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'December 15, 2025';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — DCX Studios"
  description="Terms of Service for DCX Studios applications and services."
>
  <div class="bg-dark-surface min-h-screen pt-24 pb-20 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 max-w-4xl">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4 tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-accent-gray/60 text-lg">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="text-accent-gray/80 space-y-8 leading-relaxed text-lg">
        <p class="text-xl text-white">
          By accessing or using any DCX Studios application or service, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. Please read them carefully before use.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By downloading, installing, or using DCX Studios' games and services, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these terms. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our services.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">Use of Services</h2>
        <p>
          Our games and services are provided for personal, non-commercial use. You agree not to: reverse engineer or decompile our apps, copy or redistribute game content without permission, use cheats or exploits, or engage in conduct that disrupts other players' experience.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          All content within DCX Studios' games, including but not limited to graphics, music, code, characters, and game mechanics, is the intellectual property of DCX Studios and is protected by applicable copyright and trademark laws.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">In-App Purchases</h2>
        <p>
          Some of our games may offer in-app purchases. All purchases are final and non-refundable unless required by applicable law. Pricing may vary by region and is subject to change without notice.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          Our services are provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We do not guarantee that our services will be error-free, uninterrupted, or free of viruses or other harmful components.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          DCX Studios shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of our services, to the maximum extent permitted by applicable law.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Continued use of our services after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms. We will provide notice of significant changes through our website or within our apps.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions regarding these terms? Contact us at{' '}
          <a href="mailto:dcxstudios@gmail.com" class="text-primary hover:text-white transition-colors">dcxstudios@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
